Boolean mgbe-ọbịara: ['xor:'] mee: { :b <- ((onwe na: b ọ-bụghị) ma-ọ-bụ: (onwe ọ-bụghị na: b)).
}.

Mpụta dee: ['Length is:'] + ['ABCD'] ogologo.
>> x := ['ABCDE'].

Mpụta dee: ['Length is:'] + x ogologo.
((['ABC'] ogologo + 1 = 4) na: (2 ≠ 3)) ọ-bụghị ọ-bụghị eziokwu: { Mpụta dee: ['Yes']. }.
(((3 > 4) ma-ọ-bụ: (4 > 2)) na: (Eziokwu ma-ọ-bụ: Ụgha), na: (Eziokwu xor: Eziokwu) ọ-bụghị ) eziokwu: { Mpụta dee: ['Yes']. }.
{ Mpụta dee: ['Running']. } bido.
